Emerging Market Opportunities
Live-line drone installation can reduce service disruption and make sensor deployment more practical across difficult transmission corridors. Combining conductor-mounted devices with fibre-optic sensing and predictive thermal models also creates opportunities for suppliers offering integrated monitoring solutions.

Regional Market Insights
